% arXiv processing directives.
%
% Engine: pdflatex. The document uses the NeurIPS style with its preprint
% option, which expects pdflatex. cmap is loaded so that fi and fl in the
% T1-encoded Type1 fonts carry ToUnicode mappings and the text stays
% searchable.
%
% neurips_2025.sty is bundled here: TeX Live does not ship it, so without
% it this will not compile.

paper.tex toplevelfile
